{"id":"n37245-1-7","stage":3,"title":"차이점 · 差异","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37245-1-7-1","ko":"나는 그 두 개의 차이점을 잘 모르겠어.","zh":"我不太明白那两者的区别啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개의","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차이점을","meaning":"差异，不同点","explanation":"차이점：差异，不同点；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차이점","audio":"/audio/1c219583a3d4af3b6669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37245","senseId":"1","lemma":"차이점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]},{"id":"1c219583a3d4af3b","term":"차이점","zh":"差异，不同点","audio":"/audio/1c219583a3d4af3b6669.mp3","entryId":"37245","definition":"相互间的不同之处。","pronunciation":["차이쩜"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f5efede41ac1141108ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37245-1-7-2","ko":"아니, 이렇게 확실히 다른데 왜 모르겠다는 거야?","zh":"不对啊，明明差别这么明显，你怎么会说不明白呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"확실히","meaning":"确实地，准确地，确定地","explanation":"확실히：确实地，准确地，确定地","readings":[{"term":"확실히","audio":"/audio/dd38f9bfa39572acc1c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73235","senseId":"1","lemma":"확실히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른데","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠다는","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"dd38f9bfa39572ac","term":"확실히","zh":"确实地，准确地，确定地","audio":"/audio/dd38f9bfa39572acc1c6.mp3","entryId":"73235","definition":"与实际完全一样，或一定是那样地。","pronunciation":["확씰히"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/337e6f24bca40d320cbb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.885,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37245","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不对啊，明明差别这么明显，你怎么会说不明白呢？","裕敏啊，今天有什么事吗？","我不太明白那两者的区别啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不对啊，明明差别这么明显，你怎么会说不明白呢？","我不太明白那两者的区别啊。","裕敏啊，今天有什么事吗？"],"answer":0}]}
